<title>UK: Sallie Mae prices $2.049 bln bond.</title>
<headline>Sallie Mae prices $2.049 bln bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following three-tranche</p>
<p>asset-backed bond, announced earlier by lead manager Goldman</p>
<p>Sachs International, has been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   STUDENT LOAN MARKETING ASSOCIATION</p>
<p>TRANCHE A1</p>
<p> AMT	  $1.19 BLN SPREAD     +46 BP    LEGAL MAT   25.OCT.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE   91-DAY T-BILL PAY DATE   L20.MAR.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   ISS PRICE  PAR</p>
<p> NOTES	AVERAGE LIFE 2.5 YEARS. L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>TRANCHE A2</p>
<p> AMT	 $787.4 MLN SPREAD     +57 BP    LEGAL MAT   25.JAN.10</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE   91-DAY T-BILL PAY DATE   L20.MAR.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   ISS PRICE  PAR	 SPREAD	+57 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	AVERAGE LIFE SEVEN YEARS. L-LONG FIRST COUPON,</p>
<p>		THERE ARE ALSO SUBORDINATED CERTIFICATES OF $71.8</p>
<p>		MLN, PRICED 91 DAY T-BILL +85 BP</p>
<p>		RATED A2/A+, AVG LIFE 8.9 YEARS</p>
</text>
